{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_018ele01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_018ele01_title", "source_sha256": "16354cf94ffb6c5e796926d8d07628f84b2a0f0b260b29cde33c3a556b7eb552", "ja": "エレナとおでかけ1", "zh": "和艾莲娜外出1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_018ele01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_018ele01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "75d01b8856b540628b0e4b7e6b82d6dcef38b67f9d215f7c9faebe9350de106f", "ja": "エレナとおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和艾莲娜外出的片段。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_018ele01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_018ele01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b05fac15d2cbd91029ca9b3f13c16541aa539501e78c723825cfb3781810953c", "ja": "（今日のエレナは、札幌のラジオ局での仕事だった。\n北海道に来て印象的だった事を、楽しく話せてたな！）", "zh": "（今天艾蕾娜的工作是在札幌的广播电台。她开心地聊了聊来到北海道后印象深刻的事情！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_018ele01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_018ele01_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "5c5a127ca182b4a4687618610af42fd6d02e1592c4d334b3ab3d9d5e27a35d67", "ja": "{$P$}！\nワタシのトーク、どうだったかナ？", "zh": "{$P$}！\n我刚才聊得怎么样呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_018ele01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_018ele01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "51b11485663c6d62ed5911cfe0cafc9d31e898691f5144dfb11ffe8ac219c21a", "ja": "すごく良かったよ。特に漁港めぐりの話とか、\nあと温泉のサルの話も面白かったな。", "zh": "特别精彩。尤其是逛渔港的故事，还有温泉猴子的故事，也很有意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_018ele01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_018ele01_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "e2894499bcb3fa5d8e1421c396f56a0a895b590291b400ce2bd474aa57b850ae", "ja": "エヘヘっ♪　北海道のみんなも、\n楽しんで聞いてくれるといいナ～♪", "zh": "嘿嘿♪希望北海道的大家也能开心地听我讲～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_018ele01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_018ele01_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "fb7241d418099c8f43ec14d9d90ac9022e6237e2cf99eea9aef664448b1bb9ee", "ja": "{$P$}が、ツアーの合間にいろんな\nトコに連れてってくれたからだヨ！　ありがとネ♪", "zh": "都是因为{$P$}在巡演间隙带我去了好多地方呀！谢谢你哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_018ele01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_018ele01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "4db40b11c78c84445f6f084d837e286d73e8c2cadb20aa7424ba2ff3a1a03f62", "ja": "どういたしまして。仕事に繋がるなら、\nどんなところにだって連れて行くさ。", "zh": "不客气。只要能和工作联系起来，\n无论什么地方我都会带你去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_018ele01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_018ele01_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "159f5709e9c179922ed00c074cf91d12334570d5d40108fe86251c3e044e4499", "ja": "ホント？　行きたいとこ、まだいっぱいあるヨ！\nクマの牧場と、知床と。あとクリオネも見たいし……。", "zh": "真的吗？我想去的地方还有好多呢！\n比如熊牧场、知床。还有，我也想看看海天使……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_018ele01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_018ele01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6577d11089896e74c52170deeb5472893590c9be17b13a0efb5203694c8e5b81", "ja": "待ってくれ、エレナ。北海道は広いんだぞ。\nそれ全部行くとしたら、一週間は必要……。", "zh": "等一下，艾莲娜。北海道很大的啊。\n要是那些地方全都去一遍，至少得花一个星期……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_018ele01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_018ele01_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "10cc2eebf78ee3c585a3233fa43ac682893f64ba36d3490dc1a2eb886a412ca5", "ja": "えー！？　全部行きたいのに～！\n{$P$}、どうしてもダメなノ？", "zh": "诶——！？明明想全部去一遍的～！\n{$P$}，真的不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_018ele01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_018ele01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "435f4419a5ea838e58d5d037eeacab12b337ebad6a227f621e45a110d1855b06", "ja": "（北海道の地図を見せつつ解説をして、どうにか\nエレナを説得した。本当に、でっかいどうだな……！）", "zh": "（一边给她看北海道的地图一边解释，总算说服了艾蕾娜。真不愧是北海道，真大啊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
